Third-party data

The compiled blocklists in blocklists/ incorporate data from:

  - AdGuard Filters   https://github.com/AdguardTeam/AdguardFilters   (CC BY-SA 3.0)
  - EasyList          https://github.com/easylist/easylist            (GPL-3.0 / CC BY-SA 3.0)

Those lists are data, not code, and are not linked into the application binary.
They retain their own licences. No GPL-licensed source code is vendored into this
repository. If code from RethinkDNS or NetGuard is ever incorporated, this project
relicenses to GPL-3.0 at that point.
